<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 357-day T-bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 357-day T-bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish central bank on Thursday  said the Treasury would auction 357-day T-bills on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It last sold 259.9 trillion lira worth of 11-mth T-bills on August 12.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : August 12, 1998.</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: August 19, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : August 20, 1997.</p>
<p>The Treasury also announced on Thursday that it would open its first ever reverse T-bill auction on Monday to buy back bills due to mature on December 10. -- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
